WEBVTT

00:17:26.416 --> 00:17:30.545
while a pandemic is ongoing,
in less than 12 months.

00:17:30.921 --> 00:17:33.048
But the challenges
that we have at the moment

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:36.676
is that we don't have
sufficient production capacity.

00:17:36.676 --> 00:17:40.138
Ideally, we would be
prepared the next time,

00:17:40.180 --> 00:17:43.975
not only to develop a vaccine
in light speed,

00:17:44.017 --> 00:17:48.396
but also to to make and distribute
the vaccine in light speed.

00:17:48.814 --> 00:17:52.859
So what we need now is an additional
element which was not existing,

00:17:52.901 --> 00:17:55.403
is manufacturing capacity.

00:17:55.445 --> 00:17:58.115
And idle manufacturing capacity.

00:17:58.156 --> 00:18:01.868
We must be bringing us into a position